WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.060
Summer.

2
00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:05.460
Four friends sit round a small
fire on a hill above the sea.

3
00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.820
A year later, it's winter.

4
00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.780
One of them climbs back up, alone.

5
00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:14.710
Hardy's poem starts with the
memory: "Where we made the fire,

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.290
In the summer time".

7
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:20.750
Now there's only "a burnt
circle", and a few charred sticks.

8
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.940
It's a patch of burnt grass.

9
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:25.390
So why does it matter so much to him?

10
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.480
In this mission, you'll compare
the hill in summer and in winter.

11
00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.400
What is the weather doing there?

12
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.680
You'll follow the speaker
back to that forsaken place.

13
00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:40.210
And you'll see how short, halting lines
and shifting stanzas shape his climb.

14
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:45.040
Your mission: explain why that
burnt circle matters so much to him.
